SUMMARY:Vulcanalia
DESCRIPTION:This is a Level 1: Other (Branch primary events of regional or 
 Kingdom interest) event.\n\nBarony of Vulcanfeldt invites one and all to o
 ur Annual Vulcanalia event and Champions Tournaments for Marshal Activitie
 s including: Heavy fighting and Archery. Fun Shoots\, York\, Flight\, Clou
 t and Light you're Dead are always a hoot. We will also have a "Double Tap
 " duo Largesse Competition for our A&amp;\;S participants along with an A&amp;a
 mp\;S display opportunity. Gate opens at 2PM Friday 9/25/26 Cash or Check 
 only. Camping is encouraged\, and there's plenty of space for RVs to boond
 ock. Thank you in advance for volunteers to help set up\, serve at gate\, 
 help with Lists\, as well as run archery ranges and tear down on Sunday. C
 ome and swear fealty to our Baron and Baroness: His Excellency Sir Steinar
  and her Excellency Tai. Win Prizes\, Word fame and enjoy the merriment of
  comradery.Event Dates: Friday September 25 \, 2026 until Sunday September
 \, 27 2026Event site:Fullbright Park4508 Main St. Union Gap\, WA 98903Even
 t Steward: Ionamyst ReginasdottirCo Steward: Sjofn Larsdottir
