URL:https://antir.org/events/border-war-24/
SUMMARY:Border War
DESCRIPTION:This is a Level 1: Other (Branch primary events of regional or 
 Kingdom interest) event.\n\nBorder War is the Barony of Wealdsmere's war e
 vent. It is a weekend of fighting in the spectacular fall beauty of Lake C
 ouer d'Alene.\n\nGather warriors! Gather Bards! Gather Artists! Gather all
  good people of An Tir!&nbsp;\n\nJoin the call of Wealdsmere to raise great Wa
 r Bands and march in defense of our Eastern Borders\, to drive away enemie
 s and make merry with those seeking respite in the shade of tall pines\, b
 eside cool waters\, safely away from bandits and ruffians who roam the wil
 d lands - and the monsters that dwells in the depths.\n\nWe shall break br
 ead in fellowship after a day of breaking bones in war.\n\nWe shall gather
  round the evening fires and share tales of great deeds done dirt cheap. (
 Sheep?)\n\nThere will be war. All the war your barbarian little hearts can
  handle.\n\nRetreat is not an option!\n\nCamp Easton will host us once aga
 in on the shores of beautiful Lake Coeur D’Alene. War points will be awa
 rded for all activities which include\, but are not limited to: Heavy figh
 ting\, rapier fighting\, Arts and Sciences competition\, Bardic\, voluntee
 r opportunities and water bearing\, youth activities\, and classes.\nThis 
 site features real bathrooms and hot showers and yes...Cabins! There are a
  limited number of cabins to reserve.\n\n\n\nSite Rules:\n\n 	This is a Sc
 out camp. Therefore it is a DRY site. Please respect the Scouts rules.\n 	
 This is a wildlife area - Please leave pets at home. Populace with service
  animals please use extreme caution.\n 	The lake is deep\, cold\, and prob
 ably has a plesiosaur in it. Their name is Paddler. Swimming is not advise
 d.\n 	Parents - please mind your children. There are cars\, bears and coug
 ars around. Also see above about the lake monster.\n 	If you pack it in\, 
 please pack it out and practice “Leave No Trace”\n 	Restrooms and Show
 ers are available\, as well as limited access to power - there will be a t
 able set up in the main hall to charge cell phones\, etc.\n\n\nPlease chec
 k back often as we will be updating this page more
CATEGORIES:Wealdsmere
LOCATION:Camp Easton\, 23516 S. Hwy 97\, Harrison\, ID\, 83833\, United Sta
 tes
GEO:47.5996071885006;-116.776322556097
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=23516 S. Hwy 97\, Harrison\
 , ID\, 83833\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Camp Easton:geo:47
 .5996071885006,-116.776322556097
END:VEVENT
