URL:https://antir.org/events/tir-righ-arts-sciences-bardic-championships-7
 /
SUMMARY:Tir Righ Arts\, Sciences &amp;\; Bardic Championships 2026
DESCRIPTION:The Shire of Appledore is delighted to host Tir Righ for the Pr
 incipality Arts &amp;\; Sciences and Bardic Championships at the Quail's Ne
 st Arts Centre in Oliver\, BC.\n\nWe will open the site for setup at 8am w
 ith the event and gate starting at 9am. Opening court is tentatively sched
 uled for 9:30am. A full schedule and activities will appear on the Faceboo
 k Event page closer to the event.\n\n&nbsp;\;\n\nOliver\, BC is found betwe
 en Penticton and Osoyoos on Highway 97 in the South Okanagan. From the Nor
 th and West\, make your best way to Penticton and head south on Highway 97
  until you are in Oliver. Turn left onto Similkameen Avenue and then your 
 first right on Apirport Street. From points East\, make your way to Osoyoo
 s\, turn right onto Highway 97 to Oliver\, right onto Similkameen\, then r
 ight on Airport Street.\n\nOliver is a small town packed with amenities. T
 here are hotels\, grocery stores\, and restaurants in easy walking distanc
 e. Local wineries and fruit stands are found throughout the region.\n\nThe
  site is the quirky\, charming Arts Centre. There ample parking\, an acces
 sible entrance and an accessible washroom. We will have site tea\, coffee 
 and hot water for a donation.&nbsp; We will also have various popups available
  for gathering space.\n\nMerchants\, should there be any interested\, shou
 ld contact the event steward. We will not charge a merchant fee.\n\nThe si
 te fee is $35.00 less the $10 non-member surcharge for SCA members. Youth 
 age 18 and younger are free.\n\n&nbsp;\;\n\n&nbsp;\;
CATEGORIES:Appledore,Principality of Tir Righ
LOCATION:Quails Nest Arts Centre\, 5840 Airport Road\, Oliver\, BC\, V0H 1T
 0\, Canada
GEO:49.1756465;-119.5517114
