SUMMARY:Rose and Thorn Symposium
DESCRIPTION:This is a Level 1: Other (Branch primary events of regional or 
 Kingdom interest) event.\n\nSaturday: 9:00 AM to 9:00 PM\n\nSunday: 9:00 A
 M to 4:00 PM\n\nJoin us in Caladphort for a celebration of the underrepres
 ented gender fighting community! We will have rapier\, cut and thrust\, an
 d armored tournaments as well as classes tailored to the martial community
 .\nPlease note we have a new site this year at the Grays Harbor Historic S
 eaport in Aberdeen\, WA\, home of the Lady Washington.\n\n&nbsp;\;\n\nYou w
 ill want to bring your own chairs. This is a new site that is in the early
  stages of renovation so anything we don't bring we don't have.
