URL:https://antir.org/events/tournament-of-the-golden-swan-16/
SUMMARY:Tournament of the Golden Swan
DESCRIPTION:The good shire of Appledore invites one and all to join the est
 imable Ladies of the Golden Swan to celebrate scholarship and persona deve
 lopment during this long weekend event. Join us beneath the boughs and wit
 hin Cawston Hall as we entertain one who would challenge the contests to c
 all themselves a Golden Swan.\n\nTravel back to a simpler SCA time\, when 
 camaraderie and revelry reigns\, for communal breakfasts\, cozy camping\, 
 two pot luck feasts\, singing\, games\, dancing\, and laughing long into t
 he night.\n\nThe persona development challenge fosters knowledge of the li
 ves of women in the middle ages. A successful Golden Swan demonstrates a l
 evel and depth of understanding of what a woman's life was like in her giv
 en time period that may be unequalled even in the highest academic circles
 . The contest consists of several round table discussions\, private demons
 trations of skills\, and the ongoing challenge of remaining in persona com
 pletely from Saturday morning until Sunday afternoon. Everyone at the even
 t is encouraged to participate in the discussion\, and attempt to present 
 themselves in their most fullsome medieval manner.\n\n&nbsp;\;
CATEGORIES:Appledore
LOCATION:Cawston Community Hall\, 2119 Main Street\, Cawston\, BC\, V0X 1C1
 \, Canada
