URL:https://antir.org/events/hartwood-fall-tutr-2/
SUMMARY:Hartwood Fall TUTR 2026
DESCRIPTION:HARTWOOD FALL TUTR 2026\n\n\n&nbsp;\;\n\nHarken now\, good schol
 ars!\n\nThe Shire of Hartwood is once again holding classes for The Univer
 sity of Tir Righ.&nbsp; Join us and our amazing instructors at the Beban Socia
 l Centre in Nanaimo where they will share their skills and answer question
 s on October 17th and 18th.\n\nClasses include but are certainly not limit
 ed to: Wire Weaving\, Medieval Poetry\, Birgitte Cap\, How to Make eyelets
 \, and many\, many more.&nbsp;\n\nBetween classes\, relax with friends\, new a
 nd old\, and enjoy lunch and snacks by donation. We hope you’ll also joi
 n us for Saturday night’s potluck and enjoy our entertainment.\n\nThe si
 te admission cost is $35. SCA members will receive a $10-off discount (bri
 ng your membership ID!) and Seniors and Students will also receive $5-off 
 with ID.\n\nAs each course is different and will have different material r
 equirements\, expect to pay a small cost for each course to the instructor
  (separate from the site admission fee).\n\nDoors will open at 8:00 AM Sat
 urday\, October 18th\, with Gate opening at 08:30. Classes end at 3:00 PM 
 Sunday.\nPRE-REGISTRATION FOR CLASSES IS REQUIRED and will open Sept 22\, 
 2026 and closes Oct 12\, 2026. Register early as classes fill up quickly!
 &nbsp;\n\nClasses will be available for pre-view as of September 15th!\nACCOMM
 ODATION: Some billeting space will be available. More information to follo
 w.\n\nFOOD: There will be day food available both days by donation as well
  as a potluck dinner on Saturday.&nbsp;\n\nNO PETS as per the facilities rules
 . Service animals must have proper documentation. No exceptions.\n\nCheck 
 our FB event page for additional information\n\nNote: This is an SCA event
  and students are expected to wear period clothing (except for off-site cl
 asses).\n\nIf you have any questions about courses\, please contact the TU
 TR class coordinators: Mistress Alicia le Wilfulle and Lady Beatrice inghe
 an Ghiolla Mhuire at hartwood.tutr@tirrigh.org.&nbsp;\n\nFor non-class related
  questions\, please contact the event steward Arrindís inn kyrri at Arinn
 disInnKyrri@gmail.com.
CATEGORIES:Hartwood
LOCATION:Beban Park Social Centre\, 2300 Bowen Rd\, Nanaimo\, BC\, V9T 3K7\
 , Canada
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=2300 Bowen Rd\, Nanaimo\, B
 C\, V9T 3K7\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Beban Park Social Centre:g
 eo:0,0
END:VEVENT
