URL:https://antir.org/events/autumn-colloquium-samhain/
SUMMARY:Haust-Boð
DESCRIPTION:The chill in the air\n\nThe crunch of the leaves\n\nA cauldron 
 of soup bubbles over a crackling fire\n\nLet’s Celebrate the Fall season
  with food\, friends and learning\n\nHaust-Boð\n\nThe name Haust-Boð (pr
 onounced Howst-both) comes from Old Norse and can be translated as Autumn 
 Feast.\n\nThe idea is to gather together and celebrate our wins over this 
 last event season. Swap stories of your battles on the field\, retell your
  best “there I was stories” share knowledge in the form of classes or 
 game plan next event season.\n**Site Rules**\n\n 	No Weapons on site\n 	
 “Discretely Wet” Although we have purchased a banquet license\, if you
  decide to enjoy adult beverages please keep your sensibilities about your
 self and remember your actions reflect upon the Barony and SCA as a whole.
 \n\n&nbsp;\;\n\nThis is a Level 2: Branch Event where no Kingdom or Princip
 ality business is expected to be conducted event.\n\n&nbsp;\;
CATEGORIES:Madrone
LOCATION:Fauntleroy United Church of Christ\, 9140 California Avenue SW\, S
 eattle\, WA\, 98136\, Western\, United States
