SUMMARY:Bubba's Birthday Party
DESCRIPTION:Baron John and Baroness Margaret invite you to join the Barony 
 of Wyewood in celebrating the birthday of our beloved Mascot\, Bubba.\n\nW
 yewood is taking a day to come together to celebrate our history and the b
 arony with a potluck (main dish provided by the barony)\, and a panel disc
 ussion of the History of Wyewood especially how Wyewood and Bubba came to 
 be.&nbsp; There will be classes\, dance\, a scribal area\, and a prize rapier 
 tournament as we celebrate the day together.\n\nAnd cake! There will be bi
 rthday cake!\n\nMistress Symonne and her crew will be serving pork tenderl
 oin roast with sauces and chicken. Please bring side dishes or desserts to
  contribute\, and please include and ingredient list for safety.\n\n&nbsp;\
 ;\n\n&nbsp;\;
