SUMMARY:Baronial Banquet Lions Gate 2026
DESCRIPTION:This is a Level 2: Branch Event where no Kingdom or Principalit
 y business is expected to be conducted event.\n\n3:00 PM-11:00 PM\n\nBaron
 ess’ Banquet 2026: A Journey Along the Silk Road\nThe Barony of Lions Ga
 te invites you into an evening of lantern light\, feast\, music\, story\, 
 and splendour inspired by the Silk Road. Baroness’ Banquet will be imagi
 ned as a journey through the great cultural hubs of that historic route\, 
 with the hall transformed into a vibrant indoor market of rich décor\, wa
 rmth\, and welcome. Guests can look forward to a feast shaped as a Path th
 rough major Silk Road influences\, alongside dance\, storytelling\, and a 
 joyful bardic close to the evening. We also warmly encourage those with pe
 rsonas from lands along the Silk Road to dress in their finest and help ma
 ke the night a celebration of garb\, culture\, and pageantry.
