DESCRIPTION:Come one\, Come all as we witness the Coronets of the Summits m
 ove in succession to the heirs Viscount Sir William Geoffrey and HL Jack\n
 \nFeel the strength of the blade while watching new champion of rapier win
  the day in the Captain of Cats Tournament.\n\nShare the joys as His Royal
  Majesty bestows bounteous awards.\n\n&nbsp;\;\n\nUnder the glowing pantheo
 n of Glyn Dwfn\, do we invite you south: December 12\, 2026. The doors of 
 the Pagdham Building at the Jackson County Expo will open at 9:00am\, clos
 e at 9:00pm. (21 Peninger Rd\nCentral Point\, OR 97502)\n\nIn service - Yo
 ur Event Steward\,\nHL Kanavati
